Super-simple way to remember them
Concept	Main idea	Question it answers
Encapsulation	Protect internal state	"Who can change my data?"
Polymorphism	Same interface, different behavior	"How can different objects respond to the same call?"
Interface	Define a contract	"What must this object be able to do?"
Composition	Combine objects	"How can I build a bigger object from smaller ones?"

One line trick
Encapsulation → Hide
Interface     → Promise
Polymorphism  → Vary
Composition   → Combine